  m_text: "Asgard is a majestic realm, home to gods like Odin and Thor. It is a grand,
    fortified celestial city, accessible via the rainbow bridge, Bifrost. \nAsgard
    features opulent halls like Valhalla, where honored warriors reside. The realm
    symbolizes strength, wisdom, and divine order."
