  m_text: In the lush landscapes of Vanaheim, the nameless being encounters a tribe
    of nature-worshipping shamans channeling the power of the elements to heal and
    nurture their land. Inspired by their reverence for the natural world, they delve
    into the mysteries of plant life, learning to coax vines and flora into breathtaking
    works of art. Guided by wise druids, they cultivate gardens and arboreal sanctuaries,
    their ability to harness the vitality of nature becoming an integral aspect of
    their abilities.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
